  now:/^Imaging satellite (.+) OVERHEAD NOW \(max elevation (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?) degrees\) — cover sensitive activity$/,
  reason:/^(SIMULATED exhibition demo \(fast-forward to the next real pass\) — )?The imaging satellite (.+) \(NORAD (\d+)\) rises at ([0-9:]+), is highest \((-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)°, azimuth (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)°\) at ([0-9:]+) and sets at ([0-9:]+)\. While it is above the horizon it can photograph or radar-image the site\. Cover sensitive equipment and pause sensitive outdoor activity until it has passed\.$/,
  over:/^(SIMULATED: )?(.+) OVERHEAD NOW \(elevation (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)°, highest (-?\d+(?:\.\d+)?)°\)$/,
  set:/^(.+) has set below the horizon — pass over, closed automatically$/,
