const rdtSounds=()=>[['vault',TX('الخزنة','Vault')],['gateb',TX('البوابة B','Gate B')],['weapon',TX('سلاح','Weapon')],['fence',TX('السياج','Fence')],['drone',TX('مسيّرة','Drone')],['aircraft',TX('طائرة','Aircraft')],['space',TX('قمر صناعي','Satellite')],['metal',TX('معدن','Metal')],['wireless',TX('جهاز لاسلكي','Wireless device')],['system',TX('النظام','System')]];

function rdtRunning(){ return Object.values(RDT.res).some(r=>r.st==='run'); }
function rdtTick(){
  const now=Date.now(); let changed=false;
  for(const t of rdtTests()){ const r=RDT.res[t.id]; if(!r||r.st!=='run') continue;
    if(t.kind==='vault'){ for(const i of (LIVE.inc||[])){ if(i.key!=='vault'||(i.createdAt||0)<r.start) continue; const m=((i.ev||[]).find(e=>/^Sensor: /.test(e))||'').slice(8); if(m&&!r.hits[m]){ r.hits[m]=true; changed=true; } }
      const got=RDT_VAULT.filter(x=>r.hits[x]); if(got.length===RDT_VAULT.length){ Object.assign(r,{st:'pass',at:now,note:TX('الخمسة كلها أرسلت إنذارها','All five raised their alarm')}); changed=true; }
      else if(now>r.until){ const miss=RDT_VAULT.filter(x=>!r.hits[x]).map(x=>rdtVaultT()[x]); Object.assign(r,{st:'fail',at:now,note:TX(`وصل ${got.length} من ${RDT_VAULT.length} · لم يصل: ${miss.join('، ')}`,`${got.length} of ${RDT_VAULT.length} arrived · missing: ${miss.join(', ')}`)}); changed=true; } }
    else { const note=t.hit(r.start); if(note){ Object.assign(r,{st:'pass',at:now,note}); changed=true; } else if(now>r.until){ Object.assign(r,{st:'fail',at:now,note:TX(`لم تصل أي إشارة خلال ${t.secs} ثانية`,`No signal arrived within ${t.secs} s`)}); changed=true; } }
  }
  if(changed) rdtSave();
  if(!rdtRunning()){ clearInterval(RDT.timer); RDT.timer=null; }
  else if(++RDT.n%3===0) coreRefresh(false).catch(()=>{});
  if(route()==='devices'&&rdTab==='test') safeRender();
}
async function rdtStart(id){
  const t=rdtTests().find(x=>x.id===id); if(!t) return; const now=Date.now();
  if(RDT.res[id]&&RDT.res[id].st==='run'){ RDT.res[id]={st:'fail',at:now,note:TX('أُوقف الاختبار','Test stopped')}; rdtSave(); safeRender(); return; }
  if(t.kind==='check'){ RDT.res[id]={st:'run',start:now,until:now+15000}; safeRender();
    try{ await coreRefresh(false); }catch(e){}
    const h=((LIVE.ready&&LIVE.ready.health)||[]).find(x=>x.id===t.hid);
    RDT.res[id]=h&&h.status==='ok'?{st:'pass',at:Date.now(),note:AR(h.detail)}:{st:'fail',at:Date.now(),note:h?AR(h.detail):TX('لا يوجد فحص لهذا الجزء','No check for this part')};
    rdtSave(); safeRender(); return; }
  if(t.kind==='lock'){ try{ await api('gate/remote-open',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({reason:TX('اختبار صيانة للقفل','Lock maintenance test')})}); }
    catch(e){ RDT.res[id]={st:'fail',at:now,note:e.message}; rdtSave(); safeRender(); return; }
    RDT.res[id]={st:'run',start:now,until:now+t.secs*1000,lock:true}; }
  else RDT.res[id]={st:'run',start:now,until:now+t.secs*1000,hits:{}};
  if(!RDT.timer) RDT.timer=setInterval(rdtTick,1000);
  safeRender();
}
function rdtPlay(kind){
  if(RDT.audio){ try{ RDT.audio.pause(); }catch(e){} RDT.audio=null; }
  if(RDT.playing===kind){ RDT.playing=null; safeRender(); return; }
  const urls=kind==='abdullah'?['/sawn-demo/assets/voice/abdullah/01-intro.mp3']:[`/sawn-demo/assets/voice/sawn-${kind}-ar.mp3`,`/sawn-demo/assets/voice/sawn-${kind}-en.mp3`]; RDT.playing=kind; safeRender();
  const next=i=>{ if(RDT.playing!==kind) return; if(i>=urls.length){ RDT.playing=null; safeRender(); return; } const a=new Audio(urls[i]); RDT.audio=a; a.onended=()=>next(i+1); a.onerror=()=>{ toast(TX('تعذّر تشغيل الملف','Could not play the file')); next(i+1); }; a.play().catch(()=>{ toast(TX('المتصفح منع الصوت — اضغط على الصفحة ثم أعد المحاولة','The browser blocked the sound — click the page and try again')); RDT.playing=null; safeRender(); }); };
  next(0);
}
function rdtCard(t){
  const r=RDT.res[t.id]||{}, now=Date.now(), run=r.st==='run', can=coreCan(t.kind==='lock'?'incidents.handle':'incidents.view');
  let res='';
  if(run&&t.kind==='vault') res=`<div class="rdt-chips">${RDT_VAULT.map(x=>`<span class="${r.hits&&r.hits[x]?'ok':''}">${rdtVaultT()[x]}</span>`).join('')}</div><em>${TX('بانتظار الحساسات','Waiting for the sensors')} · <span class="num">${Math.max(0,Math.ceil((r.until-now)/1000))}</span> ${TX('ث','s')}</em>`;
  else if(run&&r.lock) res=`<em>${TX('أُرسل الطلب: بانتظار موافقة شخص ثانٍ','Request sent: waiting for a second person to approve')} · <a href="#alerts" data-rdtapr>${TX('فتح الموافقات','Open approvals')}</a></em>`;
  else if(run) res=`<em>${t.kind==='check'?TX('جارٍ الفحص…','Checking…'):TX('بانتظار الإشارة','Waiting for the signal')+` · <span class="num">${Math.max(0,Math.ceil((r.until-now)/1000))}</span> ${TX('ث','s')}`}</em>`;
  else if(r.st) res=`<em>${r.st==='pass'?'✓ '+TX('نجح','Passed'):'✕ '+TX('لم ينجح','Not passed')} · <span class="num">${audTime(r.at)}</span></em><small>${esc_(r.note||'')}</small>`;
  return `<div class="rdt ${r.st||''}"><span class="rdt-ic">${rdtIco(t.ic)}</span><div class="rdt-b"><b>${t.t}</b><small>${t.how}</small>${res}</div><button type="button" class="btn sm ${run?'':'pri'}" data-rdt="${t.id}" ${can?'':'disabled'}>${run?TX('إيقاف','Stop'):r.st?TX('إعادة','Again'):TX('ابدأ','Start')}</button></div>`;
}
function rdtPanel(){
  const T=rdtTests(), grp=(k,title,ic)=>mp(title,`<div class="rdt-g">${T.filter(t=>t.g===k).map(rdtCard).join('')}</div>`,'','','');
  const done=T.filter(t=>(RDT.res[t.id]||{}).st==='pass').length, bad=T.filter(t=>(RDT.res[t.id]||{}).st==='fail').length;
  const snd=`<div class="rdt-snd">${rdtSounds().map(([k,t])=>`<button type="button" class="rdt-sb${RDT.playing===k?' on':''}" data-rdts="${k}">${rdtIco('sound',18)}<span>${t}</span></button>`).join('')}<button type="button" class="rdt-sb ab${RDT.playing==='abdullah'?' on':''}" data-rdts="abdullah">${rdtIco('sound',18)}<span>${TX('صوت عبدالله','Abdullah’s voice')}</span></button></div><div class="muted-s" style="padding:0 16px 14px">${TX('كل زر يشغّل تسجيل الإنذار بالعربية ثم الإنجليزية. اضغط مرة ثانية للإيقاف.','Each button plays the alert recording in Arabic, then English. Press again to stop.')}</div>`;
  return `<div class="rdt-sum"><span class="ok"><b class="num">${done}</b>${TX('نجح','passed')}</span><span class="no"><b class="num">${bad}</b>${TX('لم ينجح','not passed')}</span><span><b class="num">${T.length-done-bad}</b>${TX('لم يُختبر','not tested')}</span><button type="button" class="btn sm" data-rdtall>${TX('افحص كل ما يُفحص تلقائياً','Run every automatic check')}</button><button type="button" class="btn sm" data-rdtclr>${TX('مسح النتائج','Clear results')}</button></div>`
    +`<div class="rdt-cols">${grp('a',TX('البوابة A','Gate A'))}${grp('b',TX('البوابة B · المستوى 5','Gate B · Level 5'))}</div>`
    +grp('v',TX('الخزنة','Vault'))+grp('s',TX('المجال الجوي والخدمات','Airspace and services'))
    +mp(TX('أصوات الإنذار','Alert sounds'),snd,'','flush','');
}
function rdTabs(okN,issues,ncN){
  const tabs=[['ov',TX('نظرة عامة','Overview'),'chip'],['chk',TX('الفحوص','Checks'),'wifi'],['test',TX('الاختبارات','Tests'),'lock'],['mnt',TX('الصيانة','Maintenance'),'keypad']];
  return `<div class="mtabs rdtabs">${tabs.map(([k,t,ic])=>`<button type="button" data-rdtab="${k}" aria-pressed="${rdTab===k}">${rdtIco(ic,15)} ${t}${k==='chk'&&issues?` <span class="num rdt-bad">${issues}</span>`:''}</button>`).join('')}</div>`;
}
function bindReadyTests(C){
  C.querySelectorAll('[data-rdtab]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{ rdTab=b.dataset.rdtab; try{ localStorage.setItem('sawn.rdtab',rdTab); }catch(e){} render(); });
  C.querySelectorAll('[data-rdt]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>rdtStart(b.dataset.rdt));
  C.querySelectorAll('[data-rdts]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>rdtPlay(b.dataset.rdts));
  C.querySelectorAll('[data-rdtapr]').forEach(a=>a.onclick=()=>{ try{ alF='apr'; }catch(e){} });
  const all=C.querySelector('[data-rdtall]'); if(all) all.onclick=async()=>{ for(const t of rdtTests().filter(t=>t.kind==='check')) await rdtStart(t.id); };
  const clr=C.querySelector('[data-rdtclr]'); if(clr) clr.onclick=()=>{ for(const k of Object.keys(RDT.res)) if(RDT.res[k].st!=='run') delete RDT.res[k]; rdtSave(); render(); };
}
